'''You Monster!''' is an [[Achievement]] awarded when a [[Crawler|crawler]] kills an infant.<ref>Dinniman, Matt. ''Dungeon Crawler Carl'' (Chapter 18) (pp. 142-143). Kindle Edition.</ref>

{{Quote|New achievement! You Monster! You have killed an infant! An infant! Okay, okay. Unless you're a complete psychopath, we know you probably didn't wake up this morning and tell yourself, "Today is the day I'm going to slaughter a child."

Reward: That was your reward. It was also a lie.|author=[[System AI]]}}

== Trivia ==
Carl thinks about this achievement the first time he says his mantra.<ref>Dinniman, Matt. ''The Dungeon Anarchist's Cookbook'' (Chapter 8)</ref>

